---
import Navbar from '../../components/Navbar/Navbar';
import Spacer from '../../components/Spacer/Spacer';
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { EMAIL } from '../../data/contact';
---

<Layout title="Datenschutz | Simon Brebeck">
    <Navbar />

    <Spacer height={120} />
    <main
        id="main-content"
        tabindex="-1">
        <div class="page legal">
            <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
            <p class="legal-intro">
                This website does not use cookies, analytics, tracking or contact forms. The only personal data
                processed is what is technically necessary to deliver the site to you, and anything you send me
                by email. Last updated: October 2026.
            </p>

            <div class="legal-sections">
                <section aria-labelledby="privacy-controller">
                    <h2 id="privacy-controller">Who is responsible</h2>
                    <p>The controller under the GDPR (DSGVO) is:</p>
                    <address>
                        Simon Brebeck<br />
                        Frankenstraße 10-12<br />
                        52070 Aachen<br />
                        Germany<br />
                        E-Mail: <a href={`mailto:${EMAIL}`}>{EMAIL}</a>
                    </address>
                </section>

                <section aria-labelledby="privacy-hosting">
                    <h2 id="privacy-hosting">Hosting and server log files</h2>
                    <p>
                        This website is hosted by Hetzner Online GmbH, Industriestr. 25, 91710 Gunzenhausen,
                        Germany, on a server located in Germany. I have concluded a data processing agreement with
                        Hetzner under Art. 28 GDPR, which ensures that Hetzner processes your data only on my
                        instructions and in compliance with the GDPR. Hetzner's privacy policy is available at
                        <a
                            href="https://www.hetzner.com/legal/privacy-policy"
                            target="_blank"
                            rel="noopener noreferrer">hetzner.com/legal/privacy-policy</a
                        >.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        Every time you open a page, the web server
                        automatically records information that your browser sends: your IP address, the date and
                        time of the request, the requested page, the HTTP status code, the amount of data
                        transferred, the referring page and your browser's user agent.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        This data is needed to deliver the website and to keep the server stable and secure, for
                        example to detect attacks. The legal basis is my legitimate interest under Art. 6(1)(f)
                        GDPR. The log files are not combined with other data and are deleted after 14 days at the
                        latest, unless they are needed to investigate a specific security incident.
                    </p>
                </section>

                <section aria-labelledby="privacy-email">
                    <h2 id="privacy-email">Contacting me by email</h2>
                    <p>
                        If you write me an email, I process your email address, your name if given, and the
                        content of your message to reply to you. The legal basis is Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR, or Art.
                        6(1)(b) GDPR if your message is about entering into a contract. I delete the
                        correspondence once it is no longer needed, unless statutory retention periods apply.
                    </p>
                </section>

                <section aria-labelledby="privacy-cookies">
                    <h2 id="privacy-cookies">No cookies, no tracking, no third-party content</h2>
                    <p>
                        This website sets no cookies and uses no analytics or tracking tools. Fonts and all other
                        resources are served from this server, so opening the site sends no data to third parties
                        such as Google.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        The site links to my profiles on GitHub, LinkedIn and Instagram and to other external
                        websites. No data is transferred to these services until you click such a link. After
                        that, the privacy policy of the respective website applies.
                    </p>
                </section>

                <section aria-labelledby="privacy-rights">
                    <h2 id="privacy-rights">Your rights</h2>
                    <p>
                        You have the right to access the personal data I hold about you (Art. 15 GDPR), to have it
                        corrected (Art. 16) or deleted (Art. 17), to restrict its processing (Art. 18), to data
                        portability (Art. 20), and to object to processing based on legitimate interest (Art. 21).
                        To use these rights, just send me an email.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        You can also lodge a complaint with a data protection supervisory authority, for example
                        the one responsible for me: Landesbeauftragte für Datenschutz und Informationsfreiheit
                        Nordrhein-Westfalen (<a
                            href="https://www.ldi.nrw.de"
                            target="_blank"
                            rel="noopener noreferrer">ldi.nrw.de</a
                        >).
                    </p>
                </section>

                <section aria-labelledby="privacy-encryption">
                    <h2 id="privacy-encryption">Encryption</h2>
                    <p>
                        This website uses TLS encryption (HTTPS), so data transferred between your browser and the
                        server cannot be read by third parties.
                    </p>
                </section>
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>
    <Spacer height={120} />
</Layout>

<style>
    .legal h1 {
        font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4rem);
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    }

    .legal-intro {
        max-width: 720px;
        margin-top: 24px;
        font-size: 1.1rem;
        line-height: 1.7;
        color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    }

    .legal-sections {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 40px;
        max-width: 720px;
        margin-top: 48px;
    }

    .legal h2 {
        margin-bottom: 12px;
        color: var(--color-text-muted);
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        font-weight: 500;
    }

    .legal p,
    address {
        margin: 0 0 12px;
        font-style: normal;
        font-size: 1.05rem;
        line-height: 1.7;
        color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    }

    .legal a {
        color: var(--color-text);
        text-decoration: underline;
        text-decoration-color: var(--color-border-strong);
        text-underline-offset: 4px;
        transition: text-decoration-color 0.2s ease;
    }

    .legal a:hover,
    .legal a:focus-visible {
        text-decoration-color: var(--color-accent);
    }
</style>
